    "scenesThatPass": [
      "DOLORES: I'm darn near a doctor. I did it right. She's fine. But let's go and get back. It's supposed to wear off in three hours.\nSPARKLE: Oh God, help us.",
      "SPARKLE: Pleased to meet you.\nDOLORES: Hi.",
      "SPARKLE: Dee? Don't just stand there. Say something.\nDOLORES: Congratulations.",
      "SPARKLE: We were taught that if you don't have anything nice to say, don't say anything at all.\nDOLORES: No, I want to hear it.\nSPARKLE: I have to go to the bathroom.\nDOLORES: Don't avoid me. Tell me what you think.",
      "DOLORES: All you're worried about is getting that record deal. You're not thinking about her right now because you're so busy using her like everybod…\nSPARKLE: That's not true. That's my sister. I love her.\nDOLORES: Then flush it down the toilet."
    ]
